<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Dec 19 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Dec 19 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $94.70 billion in the week to December 19 from $1.061 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     57.83		52.14</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     27.86		26.13</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  889.17	    1009.10</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    185.78	     202.40</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	698.51	     774.91</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    248.41	     286.34</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
